body:
- **Links drawn apart, name-checked** — observed `link`s (0.1.0's session links) are shown apart from parent edges on
  every view that shows both, and a link name is shown only after it parses as a viola name (`matrix#v2-10`;
  `res-ycydja7a`).

- `[inferred]` `src/run/` start path (where the lineage line is written), `src/cmd/revive*` (the parent carried), the
  board read model in `viola-state` and `src/human/board/` (the tree drawing, the piped form), `list --json`'s payload
  contract;

M6 — **what `list` and `list --json` print today.** Human, piped (M1's `list_human_board_is_the_literal_rows`, `tests/cli_list.rs:109-122`): exactly `{BAY}
{CAPTION}
{ROW}
`, no SGR (`assert_plain`), stderr empty. On a terminal the same characters plus SGR only for bold NAME, amber `DIALOG`, dim stale rows (`src/human/board/cells.rs:68-90`; `src/cmd/list.rs:49-51`: width from `viola_pty::host_size()`, colour from `human::read_colour`) — so «plain when piped» already holds for every word of today's board: the piped board is the terminal board less SGR (layout-templates · decision/words-carry-every-state). The caption is the six fixed captions (`src/human/board/rows.rs:39-43`); rows are in name order, wrapped then the unwrapped rack. `--json`: `{"v":1,"ok":{"items":[…],"skipped":{…}}}` (`src/cmd/list.rs:125-127`), each item exactly `name, wrapped, liveness, status, wheel?, dialog_pending, cli_version?, cli_verified?` — pinned by `board_read_item_serialises_to_the_contract_literal`, which also asserts no item serialises `links` (`crates/viola-state/src/board.rs:765-779`). No view prints a logged link name: the `link` / `unlink` lines print the verb's own parsed arguments (`src/cmd/link.rs:65-82`).

- the event kinds in `viola-core` (`EventKind`, 15 kinds today, `crates/viola-core/src/lib.rs:58-94`), the event line
  contract; `[premise-corrected: research §Conventions — a lineage name, like a link name, reaches no process-log
  line, so no new `ObsEvent` and no obs catalog change is planned]` the obs event catalog is not touched;

- **Reverted / negative API facts:** a name sort inside `rows.rs`'s forest was written and removed (it reddened the
  existing `board_row_style_a_live_row_bolds_its_name_and_ambers_the_dialog_word`, whose input is not name-ordered);
  the forest keeps the board's own order.

- **Coverage of new surfaces:**
  - `viola run --parent / --role` → validation {`ViolaName` parser, `is_code_word`, self-parent usage error✓} ·
    instrumentation {n/a — no line by rule} · PII {n/a — names only in `events.ndjson`/snapshot} · tests {unit
    `run_args_take_parent_and_role`, `run_lineage_*`; integ `list_*`} · a11y {n/a} · tokens {n/a}
  - `lineage` event line / snapshot field → validation {replay reads strings only; board re-parses names✓} ·
    instrumentation {n/a — log-only, no span by rule} · PII {n/a} · tests {unit `lineage_rule_*`,
    `start_state_writes_the_lineage_line_after_the_wheel_line`; integ `e5_the_replay_reads_the_lineage_the_wrapper_wrote`,
    `revive_keeps_the_recorded_parent_and_role`} · a11y {n/a} · tokens {n/a}
  - `viola list` tree + `-- LINKS --` block → validation {`ViolaName` re-parse on link pairs and parents✓, `escape_row`}
    · instrumentation {n/a} · PII {n/a} · tests {unit `board_tree_*`, `board_links_block_*`; integ
    `list_draws_a_declared_child_under_its_parent_piped`, `list_links_block_shows_a_send_link_apart_from_the_parent_edge`}
    · a11y {state as printed words; plain piped = terminal less SGR✓ (`board_tree_a_stale_child_keeps_the_dim_span_over_its_indent`)}
    · tokens {design-token✓ — SGR only through the existing `Tokens`}
  - `list --json` / MCP `list` `parent`, `role`, `links` → validation {as above} · instrumentation {n/a} · PII {n/a} ·
    tests {unit `list_document_carries_parent_role_and_links`, `board_read_*`; integ `list_json_carries_parent_and_role`}
    · a11y {n/a} · tokens {n/a}

